pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$background"
elements:
  - elementId: nav-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [0, 0, 1280, 40]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$primary"
  - elementId: nav-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 0, 400, 40]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      color: "$white"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans, MiSans"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>02 解决这个问题的难点</p>
  - elementId: page-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 55, 900, 40]
    content:
      style: "$title"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>难点一：硬件 trace 的语义极其低</strong></p>
  - elementId: intro
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 110, 1160, 40]
    content:
      fontSize: 16
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans, MiSans"
      align: [left, middle]
      text: |
        <p>硬件直接输出的不是"这个程序 open 了某个文件"，而是一串低层事件。以下是 12 种 RTL 事件类型：</p>
  - elementId: event-table
    elementType: table
    bounds: [60, 160, 1160, 400]
    columnWidths: [0.18, 0.35, 0.22, 0.25]
    rowHeights: [0.07, 0.077, 0.077, 0.077, 0.077, 0.077, 0.077, 0.077, 0.077, 0.077, 0.077, 0.077, 0.083]
    style: "$default"
    rows:
      - - content: {text: "RTL 事件"}
        - content: {text: "硬件输出字段"}
        - content: {text: "直观语义"}
        - content: {text: "语义缺失"}
      - - content: {text: "SYSCALL_ENTRY"}
        - content: {text: "PC, a7, a0-a7"}
        - content: {text: "ECALL 进入 trap"}
        - content: {text: "不说明进程/Binary"}
      - - content: {text: "SYSCALL_RET"}
        - content: {text: "PC, target, a0, duration"}
        - content: {text: "SRET 返回 U-mode"}
        - content: {text: "不关联到哪个 entry"}
      - - content: {text: "TRAP"}
        - content: {text: "cause, tval, PC"}
        - content: {text: "异常/中断"}
        - content: {text: "不说明触发上下文"}
      - - content: {text: "ARG_MEM"}
        - content: {text: "addr, data, size, last"}
        - content: {text: "内存片段"}
        - content: {text: "不是完整字符串"}
      - - content: {text: "PRIV"}
        - content: {text: "old_priv, new_priv"}
        - content: {text: "特权切换"}
        - content: {text: "不说明原因/进程"}
      - - content: {text: "RETIRE"}
        - content: {text: "PC, instr, priv"}
        - content: {text: "指令提交"}
        - content: {text: "不说明函数/行为"}
      - - content: {text: "BRANCH"}
        - content: {text: "PC, taken, target"}
        - content: {text: "分支跳转"}
        - content: {text: "不说明控制流意图"}
      - - content: {text: "JUMP"}
        - content: {text: "PC, target"}
        - content: {text: "无条件跳转"}
        - content: {text: "不说明调用关系"}
      - - content: {text: "CSR"}
        - content: {text: "csr, value, PC"}
        - content: {text: "CSR 写入"}
        - content: {text: "不说明上下文变化"}
      - - content: {text: "SATP"}
        - content: {text: "satp, value, PC"}
        - content: {text: "页表切换"}
        - content: {text: "不说明进程切换"}
      - - content: {text: "MARKER"}
        - content: {text: "value"}
        - content: {text: "窗口标记"}
        - content: {text: "不说明行为语义"}
      - - content: {text: "DROP"}
        - content: {text: "value (drop count)"}
        - content: {text: "溢出丢弃"}
        - content: {text: "不说明哪些事件丢失"}
  - elementId: bottom-note
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 575, 1160, 50]
    content:
      fontSize: 16
      color: "$primary"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans, MiSans"
      lineHeight: 1.5
      align: [left, middle]
      text: |
        <p>核心观察：裸 trace 只能说明低层事件；binary/function/process owner 依赖 ELF + ASLR/PIE + runtime map 绑定。</p>
  - elementId: footer
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 680, 400, 30]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>RV-MalTrace 深度技术汇报</p>
  - elementId: page-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [1180, 680, 60, 30]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      align: [right, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>09</p>
